        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Alexander III Commemorative egg\n- People: Peter Carl Fabergé, Nicholas II of Russia, Maria Feodorovna, Alexander III of Russia, Princess Dagmar of Denmark\n- Roles: Dowager Empress of Russia, Empress of Russia\n\nFacts:\n- Maria Feodorovna was born Princess Dagmar of Denmark on 26 November 1847.\n- Maria Feodorovna was Empress of Russia as the spouse of Emperor Alexander III, who reigned from 1881 to 1894.\n- The Alexander III Commemorative egg was made in 1909 under the supervision of the Russian jeweller Peter Carl Fabergé.\n- Nicholas II of Russia presented the Alexander III Commemorative egg to his mother, the Dowager Empress Maria Feodorovna.\n- Maria Feodorovna died on 13 October 1928.",
